'''Kanbei''' (Japanese: '''カンベエ''') is a [[Warlord]] in [[Pokémon Conquest]]. 

He, along with [[Hanbei]], is one of [[Hideyoshi]]'s personal advisers and junior Warlords. Despite his appearance, Kanbei is the younger of the two.

==In the games==
[[File:Hanbei Kanbei Chess.png|thumb|right|250px|[[Hanbei]] and Kanbei playing chess.]]
{{Spoilers}}
Kanbei and Hanbei and do not appear at all during {{DL|List of Pokémon Conquest stories|The Legend of Ransei}}, making their first appearance during Hideyoshi's story: {{DL|List of Pokémon Conquest stories|Happily Ever After}}. With their help, Hideyoshi eventually brings Ransei together as one peaceful nation.

In Kanbei's story, {{DL|List of Pokémon Conquest stories|The Visionary's Quest}}, Kanbei is tasked with gathering one hundred Pokémon for the Ignis army while Hideyoshi is away. He is also in the Hanbei's army at the beginning of Hanbei's story; {{DL|List of Pokémon Conquest stories|The Reluctant Genius}}.

